      "location": "Step 1.1",
      "defect": "unlicensed-inference",
      "evidence": "Fact [L5] says the Dirac evaluation identity “is proved locally in step 1.1.” But Step 1.1 invokes [L5] to evaluate the integral of |h-s| as zero, in order to establish that s is an admissible approximant. This uses the identity being proved; checking directly from the Dirac mass would close the small gap.",
